          }
          
      }
  </script>
  <body>
    <div class="container" id="select">
      <h2><a href="./index.html">Go в примери</a>: Избор на канал (select)</h2>
      
        <div class="row">
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Ключовата дума <code>select</code> ни позволява да очакваме (и
приемаме) данни от много канали едновременно.
Съчетаването на канали и <code>select</code> ни дава много мощ.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code empty leading">
            
          
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            <a href="https://go.dev/play/p/5NR2zwzoX5M"><img title="Run code" src="play.png" class="run" /></a><img title="Copy code" src="clipboard.png" class="copy" />
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">package</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">main</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kn">import</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">(</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="s">&#34;fmt&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="s">&#34;time&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">)</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            
          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kd">func</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nf">main</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>За целите на нашия пример ще избираме от два
канала.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">c1</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">:=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nb">make</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kd">chan</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kt">string</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="nx">c2</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">:=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nb">make</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kd">chan</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kt">string</span><span class="p">)</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Всеки канал получава някаква стойност след известно
време. Така наподобяваме да речем RPC<sup class="footnote-ref" id="fnref:rpc"><a href="#fn:rpc">1</a></sup>
действия, изпълняващи се в различни едновременни
гозадачи.</p>

<div class="footnotes">

<hr />

<ol>
<li id="fn:rpc">RPC (Remote Procedure Calls) – Извикване на отдалечени процедури</li>
</ol>

</div>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">go</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">func</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="nx">time</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Sleep</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">*</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">time</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nx">Second</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="nx">c1</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">&lt;-</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34;едно&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">}()</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">go</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="kd">func</span><span class="p">()</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="nx">time</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Sleep</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">2</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">*</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">time</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nx">Second</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="nx">c2</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">&lt;-</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="s">&#34;две&#34;</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">}()</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Използваме <code>select</code>, за да очакваме две стойности
едновременно, като извеждаме на екрана полученото
веднага щом пристигне някоя от тях.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="k">for</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="k">range</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="mi">2</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="k">select</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="p">{</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="k">case</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">писмо1</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">:=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">&lt;-</span><span class="nx">c1</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;получено&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">писмо1</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="k">case</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">писмо2</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">:=</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="o">&lt;-</span><span class="nx">c2</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">            </span><span class="nx">fmt</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="nf">Println</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;получено&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="nx">писмо2</span><span class="p">)</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">        </span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="w">    </span><span class="p">}</span><span class="w">
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
          </div><!-- end class="row" -->
      
        <div class="row">
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Получаваме стойностите <code>&quot;едно&quot;</code> и после `&ldquo;две&rdquo;, както очакваме.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code leading">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="gp">$</span> time go run select.go
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">получено едно
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">получено две</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
            <div class="col-6">
            <p>Забележете, че общото време за изпълнение е само около
две секунди, а не три, тъй като заспиването за една и
две секунди се изпълняват едновременно.</p>

          </div>
          <div class="col-6 code">
            
          <pre class="chroma"><code><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="go">real    0m2.245s</span></span></span></code></pre>
          </div>
        
          </div><!-- end class="row" -->
      
      
